# The Screeps Arena client owns everything under here: it writes its own
# jsconfig.json and typings/ into whichever folder you point it at, and
# `bin/arena deploy` drops the built main.mjs alongside them. All of it is
# generated, so only this file is tracked — enough to keep the directory in the
# repo so the client has somewhere to be pointed at on a fresh clone.
*
!.gitignore
